# Coq load path for the benchmark extraction drivers.
#
# These files live in the logical namespace Crane.Libraries.ParseALot.Benchmarking
# (CraneExtraction.v does `From Crane.Libraries.ParseALot.Benchmarking Require
# Import ConsList`). Everything else they need -- the Crane plugin, the
# Crane.Libraries.ParseALot.* theory, and CoLoR -- is resolved from the installed
# rocq-crane package, so run `make -C ../.. install` (or `dune install rocq-crane`)
# before extracting. See README.md.

-R . Crane.Libraries.ParseALot.Benchmarking

ConsList.v
ImmerFlexList.v
Extraction.v
ClosureCheck.v
CraneExtraction.v
